|---|---|---|
| 0 | P or A | yield_units >=0 |
| 1 | P | planted_day >=-1 |
| 2 | P | max_lifespan_step >=-1 |
| 3 | P | fertilized_until_day >=-1 |
| 4 | A | placed_day >=-1 |
| 5 | P | consecutive_unwatered >=0 |
| 6 | A | consecutive_unfed >=0 |

